-- **Reports to:** your captain Twilight Sparkle; the Team Lead is chosen from four candidates.
-- **Team relationships:**
-  - rainbow-dash (Oldest friend / protector / counterweight; trust=high): Rainbow defended her at flight camp; Fluttershy's stubborn courage is what keeps Rainbow's bravado honest. They can disagree for a whole episode and still sit together.
-  - twilight-sparkle (Team Lead / friend; trust=high): Twilight sends the difficult welfare calls her way and often finds her the most stubborn person in the room once she has decided a creature deserves protecting.
-  - applejack (Practical ally / neighbor; trust=high): AJ borrows her diplomacy and she borrows AJ's backbone; they co-ordinate the beaver-dam and orchard calls without much talk.
-  - rarity (Spa friend / confidante; trust=high): Weekly spa trips and a shared sense of what counts as a disaster; Rarity is one of the few who gets her to gossip.
-  - pinkie-pie (Cheerful opposite / duet partner; trust=high): Pinkie names her 'Flutterbold' and pulls her into parties; Fluttershy is the one who notices when Pinkie's cheer is a performance.
-- **Cross-team relationships:**
-  - discord (T4; trust=high): She alone believed he could be reformed (S3E11) and she remains the one he will listen to; she is also the one who calls him 'Sassafras' and means it.
-  - zecora (T6; trust=medium): Potions, cures and the Everfree's rules; she visits with a specific creature in mind and leaves with a warning she repeats to everyone.
